## Dev Boxer Services

Core services installed by Dev Boxer:

- `matron-bridge.service`: Matron-to-Claude bridge
- `matron-viewer.service`: file viewer for shared session artifacts
- `cloudflared-tunnel.service`: Cloudflare Tunnel for public hostnames
- `dev-boxer-hello-world.service`: hello-world smoke-test page

Check service status:

```bash
sudo systemctl status matron-bridge.service
sudo systemctl status matron-viewer.service
sudo systemctl status cloudflared-tunnel.service
sudo systemctl status dev-boxer-hello-world.service
```

Follow service logs:

```bash
sudo journalctl -u matron-bridge.service -f
sudo journalctl -u matron-viewer.service -f
sudo journalctl -u cloudflared-tunnel.service -f
sudo journalctl -u dev-boxer-hello-world.service -f
```

## Security Notes

- UFW defaults to deny inbound traffic.
- Web traffic should go out through Cloudflare Tunnel, not open inbound ports 80/443.
- SSH root login is disabled.
- fail2ban protects SSH.
- Unattended security updates are enabled with automatic reboots at 03:00 UTC.
- Prometheus node_exporter runs on localhost:9100 and is not exposed externally.
